.TH TOIL\-AUDIT 1 "2026-09" "toil-audit" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
toil-audit \- quantify the cost of babysitting CI/CD, in euros
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B toil-audit
.RI [ runs.json ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reads a workflow-run history and prices the human time spent re-running,
watching and unsticking it \(em so the argument for fixing a flaky pipeline
is a number rather than a complaint.
.PP
The history is either an export passed as an argument, or fetched from the
GitHub API with
.BR \-\-repo .
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Input
.TP
.I runs.json
An export, e.g.
.B "gh api 'repos/O/R/actions/runs' \-\-paginate"
or
.BR "glab api 'projects/:id/pipelines' \-\-paginate" .
.TP
.BI \-\-repo " OWNER/NAME"
Fetch the history from the GitHub API instead. The token comes from
.I GITHUB_TOKEN
or
.I GH_TOKEN
in the environment \(em never a flag.
.TP
.BI \-\-since " YYYY-MM-DD"
With
.BR \-\-repo :
only runs created on or after this date.
.TP
.BI \-\-provider " NAME"
CI system the export came from (default github).
.TP
.BI \-\-cache\-dir " DIR"
Where fetched pages are cached, so re-analysis does not re-fetch (default
.IR .toilaudit-cache ).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-cache
With
.BR \-\-repo :
always fetch; neither read nor write the cache.
.SS Costing
.TP
.BI \-\-rate " EUR"
Loaded engineer hourly rate (default 75).
.TP
.BI \-\-runner\-rate " EUR"
Runner cost per minute (default 0.0074).
.SS Output
.TP
.BI \-\-out " FILE"
Write the Markdown report here instead of standard output.
.TP
.BI \-\-attribute\-logs " DIR"
Attribute flaky recoveries to the test that caused them, reading each
failed run's log from
.IR DIR/<run_id>.txt
(or
.IR .zip ,
as the API serves them). Log content is used for matching only \(em no
excerpt reaches the report.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
A report was produced.
.TP
.B non-zero
The history could not be read or fetched.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
From an export:
.PP
.RS
.B gh api 'repos/acme/api/actions/runs' \-\-paginate > runs.json
.RE
.PP
Price it:
.PP
.RS
.B toil-audit runs.json \-\-rate 90 \-\-out toil.md
.RE
.PP
Straight from the API:
.PP
.RS
.B toil-audit \-\-repo acme/api \-\-since 2026-01-01
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gh (1).
Project documentation:
https://github.com/fabiocicerchia/toil-audit
